@consumer = http://localhost:4132/odata/v4/shop
@mgmt = http://localhost:4132/pipeline

### List registered pipelines (one per @federation.replicate entity)
GET {{mgmt}}/Pipelines

### Trigger a full replicate of ReplicatedProducts
POST {{mgmt}}/Pipelines(name='ReplicatedProducts')/start
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mode": "full" }

### Inspect the runs
GET {{mgmt}}/PipelineRuns?$orderby=startedAt desc&$top=5

### Query the locally replicated products (served from SQLite, no remote call)
GET {{consumer}}/ReplicatedProducts

### Local SQL view — only possible because data is now local
GET {{consumer}}/ExpensiveProducts

### Aggregate rollup computed locally with GROUP BY
GET {{consumer}}/CategoryStats

### ReplicatedCustomers was preloaded at startup
GET {{consumer}}/ReplicatedCustomers
